THIRD-PARTY SOURCE DATA

The rights of the original enzyme-detail source snapshot are unresolved. No
blanket licence guarantee is asserted for that absent source or for source-derived
annotations. The deposited GoldD3R file is an author-supplied export whose exact
upstream permissions have not been independently established in this review.
DDInter pair-level clinical grades, DrugBank and KEGG pair-level content, MIMIC
content and private trial/trueDDI material are excluded from this release.
Use local reconstructed DDInter grades under DDInter's own terms.

